+name: hermes-strudel-studio
+title: Hermes Strudel Studio
+repo: https://github.com/mojomast/poptart
+sha: 42356ddb9eff2eea2419bbd223ee159f353e4632
+subdir: integration/hermes
+description: >-
+  Local Strudel live-coding studio for Hermes: write patterns, hit Play, and
+  let the agent compose alongside you with one poptart_studio tool and a
+  Desktop SandboxedFrame pane. Disclosure — lazily starts a Node sidecar on
+  127.0.0.1 with a random per-install token in private profile plugin-data
